    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-1" id="fn-1" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Line 1 Note:BP p.l.c. owns 100% of BP Holdings North America Limited. &gt; BP Holdings North America Limited owns 100% of BP America Limited. &gt; BP America Limited owns 100% of BP&#160; America Inc. &gt; BP America Inc. owns 100% of BP Corporation North America Inc. &gt; BP Corporation North America Inc. owns 100% of BP Company North America Inc. &gt; BP Company North America Inc. owns 100% of The Standard Oil Company. &gt; The Standard Oil Company owns 100% of BP Pipelines (North America) Inc. &gt; BP Pipelines (North America) Inc. owns 51% of BP Midwest Product Pipelines Holdings LLC &gt; BP Midwest Product Pipelines Holdings LLC owns 56.17%&#160; of Chicap Pipe Line Company.</link:footnote>
